date-released: "2026-05-22"
version: "1.0.1"
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility package for the first pre-registered phenome-wide
  Mendelian randomization study of amyloid-PET cortical deposition against
  1,574 FinnGen R12 disease endpoints (N=500,348). The conservative
  wide-APOE-excluded instrument panel resolves to a single chr1q32.2 CR1
  signal colocalising with brain-cortical CR1 expression at PP.H4 = 0.983,
  with a pre-registered negative-control diagnostic that bounds the strength
  of the CR1-as-mediator claim under coloc.abf evidence-symmetry
  constraints. The deposit includes the locked 41-section pre-registration
  with 4 publicly-versioned amendments, the analytical pipeline (R + Python
  + bash), the per-panel instrument lists, the Amyloid-PET Causal Atlas
  (7,870 rows × 46 cols) as parquet + TSV + interactive HTML browser, per-
  stage MR result parquets, manuscript figures, and supplementary tables.
  Code is licensed MIT; derived data products are licensed CC-BY 4.0 — see
  LICENSE file for full dual-licence terms. Upstream summary-level GWAS
  data and reference panels are not redistributed; canonical sources and
  SHA256 hashes are documented for re-download.
